  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Causes of fever study: identify pathogens which cause fevers, treat them early identify underlying levels of resistance.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study aims to identify the pathogens which cause fevers, to treat them early, to identify underlying levels of resistance to existing treatments (e.g. antimicrobial resistance) and prevent these pathogens from spreading in the population.</narrative>
  </description>
